{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "edx-plugin-api",
    "name": "EDX Plugin API",
    "description": "HTTP API for the OCN Node EDX plugin (`ocn-node-edx-plugin`).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Run ocn-node-v2 with this plugin JAR in `plugins/`\n2. Import companion environment **EDX Plugin — Local**\n3. Set secrets: `cpo_token_c` (OCPI Token C for the CPO), and optionally `cdr_service_api_key` / `edc_api_key` for reference folders\n\n**Node config (example)**\n```properties\nedx.cdr.service.baseUrl=https://your-cdr-service.example.com/api\nedx.cdr.service.apiKey=<key>\n\nedx.edc.management.enabled=true\nedx.edc.management.baseUrl=http://your-connector/api/management\nedx.edc.management.apiKey=<key>\n\nedx.co2.provider.publicApiUrl=https://your-co2-provider.example.com/public/emissions\nedx.co2.provider.token=<token>\n```\n\n**Suggested order**\n1. Send a CDR through OCPI (see `docs/manual-testing.md`)\n2. **01 - CDR Lookup** — mapping / resolve / enriched\n3. **02 - CO2 Proxy** — requires CO₂ provider config\n4. **03 - Dataspace** — after first ingest provisions the CPO asset (`Authorization: Token …`)\n5. **04 / 05** — optional direct CDR service / EDC management calls for debugging\n\n**Auth for dataspace**\nFolder 03 requires the CPO's Token C in `cpo_token_c`. The collection pre-request script base64-encodes it into `cpo_auth`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "function ocpiAuth(rawKey, authKey) {",
          "  const raw = pm.environment.get(rawKey) || pm.collectionVariables.get(rawKey);",
          "  if (raw) {",
          "    const auth = 'Token ' + btoa(raw);",
          "    pm.environment.set(authKey, auth);",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set(authKey, auth);",
          "  }",
          "}",
          "",
          "const cpoCountry = pm.environment.get('cpo_country_code') || 'DE';",
          "const cpoParty = pm.environment.get('cpo_party_id') || 'CPO';",
          "const emspCountry = pm.environment.get('emsp_country_code') || 'DE';",
          "const emspParty = pm.environment.get('emsp_party_id') || 'EMS';",
          "const source = cpoCountry + '-' + cpoParty;",
          "const target = emspCountry + '-' + emspParty;",
          "const assetPrefix = pm.environment.get('asset_prefix') || 'cdr-data';",
          "",
          "pm.environment.set('cpo_source', source);",
          "pm.environment.set('emsp_target', target);",
          "pm.environment.set('asset_id', assetPrefix + ':src:' + source + ':tgt:');",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('cpo_source', source);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('emsp_target', target);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('asset_id', assetPrefix + ':src:' + source + ':tgt:');",
          "",
          "ocpiAuth('cpo_token_c', 'cpo_auth');"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "ocn_base", "value": "http://localhost:9999/ocn-v2" },
    { "key": "cdr_service_base", "value": "https://your-cdr-service.example.com" },
    { "key": "edc_management_base", "value": "http://localhost:8181/api/management" },
    { "key": "cpo_country_code", "value": "DE" },
    { "key": "cpo_party_id", "value": "CPO" },
    { "key": "emsp_country_code", "value": "DE" },
    { "key": "emsp_party_id", "value": "EMS" },
    { "key": "cpo_source", "value": "DE-CPO" },
    { "key": "emsp_target", "value": "DE-EMS" },
    { "key": "market_partner_id", "value": "4045399000008" },
    { "key": "asset_prefix", "value": "cdr-data" },
    { "key": "asset_id", "value": "cdr-data:src:DE-CPO:tgt:" },
    { "key": "cdr_id", "value": "94864128-50eb-46c6-bd9f-f4323cd4c057" },
    { "key": "co2_zone", "value": "DE_LU" },
    { "key": "test_did", "value": "did:web:example.com:consumer" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - CDR Lookup (Plugin)",
      "description": "Read endpoints exposed by the EDX plugin on the OCN node.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Resolve ingested CDR",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/cdrs/resolve?countryCode={{cpo_country_code}}&partyId={{cpo_party_id}}&cdrId={{cdr_id}}",
              "host": ["{{ocn_base}}"],
              "path": ["plugin", "edx", "cdrs", "resolve"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "countryCode", "value": "{{cpo_country_code}}" },
                { "key": "partyId", "value": "{{cpo_party_id}}" },
                { "key": "cdrId", "value": "{{cdr_id}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Resolves OCPI CDR identity to the raw ingested CDR via DB mapping (falls back to latest raw match by cdrId)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get raw CDR by service id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/cdrs/raw/{{raw_record_id}}",
            "description": "Fetches raw CDR from the configured CDR service using the ingest `rawRecordId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get ingest mapping",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/cdrs/mapping?countryCode={{cpo_country_code}}&partyId={{cpo_party_id}}&cdrId={{cdr_id}}",
              "host": ["{{ocn_base}}"],
              "path": ["plugin", "edx", "cdrs", "mapping"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "countryCode", "value": "{{cpo_country_code}}" },
                { "key": "partyId", "value": "{{cpo_party_id}}" },
                { "key": "cdrId", "value": "{{cdr_id}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get mapping by service id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/cdrs/mapping/by-service-id/{{raw_record_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get CO2-enriched CDR",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/cdrs/enriched?countryCode={{cpo_country_code}}&partyId={{cpo_party_id}}&cdrId={{cdr_id}}&zone={{co2_zone}}",
              "host": ["{{ocn_base}}"],
              "path": ["plugin", "edx", "cdrs", "enriched"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "countryCode", "value": "{{cpo_country_code}}" },
                { "key": "partyId", "value": "{{cpo_party_id}}" },
                { "key": "cdrId", "value": "{{cdr_id}}" },
                { "key": "zone", "value": "{{co2_zone}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requires `edx.co2.provider.publicApiUrl` on the node."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - CO2 Proxy (Plugin)",
      "description": "Grid intensity proxy exposed by the plugin.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get CO2 emission data",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/co2?start={{co2_start}}&end={{co2_end}}&zone={{co2_zone}}&time-resolution=Hourly&calculation-type=Consumption&emission-type=Lifecycle",
              "host": ["{{ocn_base}}"],
              "path": ["plugin", "edx", "co2"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "start", "value": "{{co2_start}}" },
                { "key": "end", "value": "{{co2_end}}" },
                { "key": "zone", "value": "{{co2_zone}}" },
                { "key": "time-resolution", "value": "Hourly" },
                { "key": "calculation-type", "value": "Consumption" },
                { "key": "emission-type", "value": "Lifecycle" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Dataspace CPO Assets & Policies (Plugin)",
      "description": "CPO asset mapping and policy management. Requires `edx.edc.management.enabled=true`. All requests require the CPO's Token C in `cpo_token_c`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get CPO asset mapping",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{cpo_auth}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/dataspace/cpos/{{cpo_country_code}}/{{cpo_party_id}}",
            "description": "Returns asset id, policy ids, and stored allowed consumers after auto-provisioning."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.assetId) pm.environment.set('asset_id', body.assetId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Replace policy consumers (full list)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{cpo_auth}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"consumers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"MARKET_PARTNER\",\n      \"id\": \"{{market_partner_id}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/dataspace/cpos/{{cpo_country_code}}/{{cpo_party_id}}/policy",
            "description": "Replaces the full allowed consumer list on both access and contract policies in EDC."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add market partner to policy",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{cpo_auth}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"consumers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"MARKET_PARTNER\",\n      \"id\": \"{{market_partner_id}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/dataspace/cpos/{{cpo_country_code}}/{{cpo_party_id}}/policy/consumers",
            "description": "Appends a MarketPartner.mpId constraint (e.g. GS1 GLN)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add DID consumer to policy",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{cpo_auth}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"consumers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"DID\",\n      \"id\": \"{{test_did}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{ocn_base}}/plugin/edx/dataspace/cpos/{{cpo_country_code}}/{{cpo_party_id}}/policy/consumers",
            "description": "Appends an identity (DID) constraint for dataspace consumers."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - CDR Service (Direct, optional)",
      "description": "Direct calls to the configured CDR ingest service (same API the plugin uses). Optional — for debugging outside the node.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ingest CDR",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{cdr_service_api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"source\": \"{{cpo_source}}\",\n  \"target\": \"{{emsp_target}}\",\n  \"cdr\": {\n    \"country_code\": \"{{cpo_country_code}}\",\n    \"party_id\": \"{{cpo_party_id}}\",\n    \"id\": \"{{cdr_id}}\",\n    \"start_date_time\": \"2025-05-21T11:33:27.538Z\",\n    \"end_date_time\": \"2025-05-21T13:03:27.538Z\",\n    \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n    \"total_energy\": 3.035,\n    \"last_updated\": \"2025-05-21T13:03:27.538Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{cdr_service_base}}/api/v1/cdr-ingest",
            "description": "Same payload shape the plugin sends after a successful OCPI CDR forward."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.rawRecordId) pm.environment.set('raw_record_id', body.rawRecordId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List raw CDRs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{cdr_service_api_key}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{cdr_service_base}}/api/v1/raw-cdr"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get raw CDR by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{cdr_service_api_key}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{cdr_service_base}}/api/v1/raw-cdr/{{raw_record_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List CO2-relevant CDRs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{cdr_service_api_key}}" },
              { "key": "x-source", "value": "{{cpo_source}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{cdr_service_base}}/api/v1/co2-relevant-cdr?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{cdr_service_base}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "co2-relevant-cdr"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Backend behind the EDC asset dataAddress. Plugin assets set `header:x-source` and omit empty `x-target`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get CO2-relevant CDR by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{cdr_service_api_key}}" },
              { "key": "x-source", "value": "{{cpo_source}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{cdr_service_base}}/api/v1/co2-relevant-cdr/{{co2_relevant_cdr_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - EDC Management (Reference, optional)",
      "description": "Direct EDC Management API calls matching what the plugin provisions. Normally automatic; use for debugging. See Eclipse Dataspace Connector management API docs for your connector version.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create CPO asset (co2-relevant-cdr)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{edc_api_key}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@vocab\": \"https://w3id.org/edc/v0.0.1/ns/\"\n  },\n  \"@id\": \"{{asset_id}}\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"name\": \"CO2-relevant CDR data from {{cpo_source}}\",\n    \"contenttype\": \"application/json\"\n  },\n  \"dataAddress\": {\n    \"type\": \"HttpData\",\n    \"baseUrl\": \"{{cdr_service_base}}/api/v1/co2-relevant-cdr\",\n    \"authKey\": \"x-api-key\",\n    \"authCode\": \"{{cdr_service_api_key}}\",\n    \"proxyBody\": \"true\",\n    \"proxyPath\": \"true\",\n    \"proxyMethod\": \"true\",\n    \"proxyQueryParams\": \"true\",\n    \"header:x-source\": \"{{cpo_source}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{edc_management_base}}/v3/assets",
            "description": "Matches the asset shape auto-created by the plugin: `x-source` = CPO source key; empty `x-target` is omitted."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create access policy",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{edc_api_key}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"@context\": [\n    \"https://w3id.org/edc/connector/management/v0.0.1\"\n  ],\n  \"@type\": \"PolicyDefinition\",\n  \"@id\": \"policy-access-{{cpo_source}}\",\n  \"policy\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Set\",\n    \"permission\": [\n      {\n        \"action\": \"use\",\n        \"constraint\": {\n          \"leftOperand\": \"MarketPartner.mpId\",\n          \"operator\": \"eq\",\n          \"rightOperand\": \"{{market_partner_id}}\"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"prohibition\": [],\n    \"obligation\": []\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{edc_management_base}}/v3/policydefinitions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create contract policy",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{edc_api_key}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"@context\": [\n    \"https://w3id.org/edc/connector/management/v0.0.1\"\n  ],\n  \"@type\": \"PolicyDefinition\",\n  \"@id\": \"policy-contract-{{cpo_source}}\",\n  \"policy\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Set\",\n    \"permission\": [\n      {\n        \"action\": \"use\",\n        \"constraint\": {\n          \"leftOperand\": \"MarketPartner.mpId\",\n          \"operator\": \"eq\",\n          \"rightOperand\": \"{{market_partner_id}}\"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"prohibition\": [],\n    \"obligation\": []\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{edc_management_base}}/v3/policydefinitions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create contract definition",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{edc_api_key}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@vocab\": \"https://w3id.org/edc/v0.0.1/ns/\"\n  },\n  \"@id\": \"contract-def-{{cpo_source}}\",\n  \"accessPolicyId\": \"policy-access-{{cpo_source}}\",\n  \"contractPolicyId\": \"policy-contract-{{cpo_source}}\",\n  \"assetsSelector\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Criterion\",\n      \"operandLeft\": \"id\",\n      \"operator\": \"=\",\n      \"operandRight\": \"{{asset_id}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{edc_management_base}}/v3/contractdefinitions"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
